WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.713
Step eight is the write path's
dry run, as the pipeline.

2
00:00:03.713 --> 00:00:07.145
You take the plan's hash, which
in a real run a second person

3
00:00:07.145 --> 00:00:10.725
would review and pass to you,
and give it to the action script.

4
00:00:10.725 --> 00:00:14.763
It reports four would-send
lines, the pipeline's writes,

5
00:00:14.763 --> 00:00:19.250
and refuses the fifth: the D M S
A's completion is a person's step.

6
00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.363
It sends nothing.

7
00:00:20.363 --> 00:00:23.982
Step nine applies it to the
fake, first as the pipeline,

8
00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:26.942
which sends its four
writes, then as a person,

9
00:00:26.942 --> 00:00:32.288
which sends the completed migration for
svc h r sync and refuses the other four.

10
00:00:32.288 --> 00:00:34.713
Each run re-reads every write.

11
00:00:34.713 --> 00:00:38.449
Then you pass a hash of zeros,
a hash nobody approved.

12
00:00:38.449 --> 00:00:42.199
The script refuses: the plan's
hash isn't the approved one,

13
00:00:42.199 --> 00:00:44.725
and it won't run a plan nobody reviewed.

14
00:00:44.725 --> 00:00:48.725
Pasted line by line, your shell
carries on after the refusal.

15
00:00:48.725 --> 00:00:53.863
Step ten runs every test: five
hundred forty-nine pass, none fail.

16
00:00:53.863 --> 00:00:55.750
Then delete the output folder.
